%% Title: Provider Registry Loading To Data Source Creation
%% @version 1.0.0
%% @date    2026-05-12
%% @type    sequenceDiagram
%% @level   System / Interaction
%% RULES: RULES.md §2.2, §2.7, ADR-005, ADR-025
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant CLI as CLI / composition entrypoint
    participant Registry as ProviderRegistry
    participant Store as provider store
    participant Config as provider config
    participant HTTP as create_adapter(...)
    participant DS as create_data_source(...)
    participant Result as provider-specific data source

    CLI->>Registry: ensure_loaded()
    Registry->>Store: load default registrations
    Store-->>Registry: provider configs
    CLI->>Registry: create_data_source(name,...)
    Registry->>Registry: resolve_provider_registry(...)
    Registry->>Config: get(name)
    Config-->>Registry: ProviderConfig
    Registry->>HTTP: create_adapter(name, http_client, logger, settings)
    HTTP-->>Registry: adapter instance
    Registry->>DS: build_data_source_creator(name)
    DS-->>Registry: creator callable
    Registry->>Result: creator(settings, pipeline_config,...)
    Result-->>CLI: DataSourcePort

    Note over Registry,Result: registry readiness and creation are separate seams, which keeps extension localized to composition.
